{"id":"dc3498f98607795c","group":"93","path":"93/93-ax-boolean-completeness.md","title":"Boolean Completeness","display":"ax-boolean-completeness — Boolean Completeness","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ax-boolean-completeness","aliases":["93-ax-boolean-completeness"],"display":"ax-boolean-completeness — Boolean Completeness","depends_on":["[[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]]","[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-consequence]]","[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-theory]]","[[93-df-consistency]]","[[93-df-complete-theory]]","[[93-df-maximal-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ax-boolean-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ax-boolean-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-boolean-completeness — Boolean Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3c8f5c9e577b791\" href=\"?note=e3c8f5c9e577b791\" title=\"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus\">93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cf7108c33537548a\" href=\"?note=cf7108c33537548a\" title=\"93-df-theory\">93-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"959f67178eec388a\" href=\"?note=959f67178eec388a\" title=\"93-df-consistency\">93-df-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1bb65160feb13df8\" href=\"?note=1bb65160feb13df8\" title=\"93-df-complete-theory\">93-df-complete-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8bbd77b21a9519f1\" href=\"?note=8bbd77b21a9519f1\" title=\"93-df-maximal-theory\">93-df-maximal-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the concrete classical presentation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e3c8f5c9e577b791\" href=\"?note=e3c8f5c9e577b791\" title=\"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus\">93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</a>, with carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span> and negation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8bbd77b21a9519f1\" href=\"?note=8bbd77b21a9519f1\" title=\"93-df-maximal-theory\">93-df-maximal-theory</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"959f67178eec388a\" href=\"?note=959f67178eec388a\" title=\"93-df-consistency\">93-df-consistency</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1bb65160feb13df8\" href=\"?note=1bb65160feb13df8\" title=\"93-df-complete-theory\">93-df-complete-theory</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\mathsf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\mathsf L)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}(\\Gamma;\\mathsf L,\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\mathsf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\mathsf L)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}(\\Gamma;\\mathsf L,\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>For classical propositional logic, maximal consistency is equivalent to\nthe conjunction of consistency and syntactic completeness.  Completeness\nalone would also admit an inconsistent theory and therefore is insufficient. All three predicates are evaluated in the same formally presented logic, and completeness uses its explicitly named classical negation.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"cf7108c33537548a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"959f67178eec388a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-complete-theory","status":"resolved","id":"1bb65160feb13df8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-complete-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-maximal-theory","status":"resolved","id":"8bbd77b21a9519f1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-maximal-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)$ is the concrete classical presentation of [[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]], with carrier $F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}$ and negation $\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}$.","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-maximal-theory","status":"resolved","id":"8bbd77b21a9519f1","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-maximal-theory]], [[93-df-consistency]], and [[93-df-complete-theory]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"959f67178eec388a","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-maximal-theory]], [[93-df-consistency]], and [[93-df-complete-theory]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-complete-theory","status":"resolved","id":"1bb65160feb13df8","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-maximal-theory]], [[93-df-consistency]], and [[93-df-complete-theory]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\mathsf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\mathsf L)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteTh}_{93}(\\Gamma;\\mathsf L,\n\\operatorname{Neg}^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1708,"backlinks":[{"id":"ea98968ac191af8c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["e3c8f5c9e577b791","bd7e4207897c8db3","afd7605d365be7b6","c2ca1af9af149e69","cf7108c33537548a","959f67178eec388a","1bb65160feb13df8","8bbd77b21a9519f1"]}